+- Product scope remains exactly:
+  - `src/csk/builds/toolchain.py`
+  - `tests/test_builds_toolchain.py`
+- Current file SHA-256 values:
+  - `636da1d5a9ad97bb5224783fdbee66549f9bb466f31e8504918847c2714ad5f5`
+    — `src/csk/builds/toolchain.py`
